OL,3,GNEWSAWhat the Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aresult means for London
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour's candidate Sagal Abdi-Wali is
OL,7,Fthe new MP for Holborn and St Pancras,
OL,8,Fhaving seen off a challenge from the
OL,9,FGreen Party in Thursday's by-election.
OL,11,FShe told BBC London just after her
OL,12,Fvictory was declared that the voters
OL,13,Fwere "looking for hope".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
