OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWhat the Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aresult means for London
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbdi-Wali, the Camden Council leader,
OL,7,Fsaid despite the national press
OL,8,Fattention, she had "focused on my own
OL,9,Fcampaign", and for the whole four
OL,10,Fweeks, "the message was very much the
OL,11,Fsame from people on the streets...
OL,12,F[they were] really positive towards me
OL,13,Fand the fact that I was a local
OL,14,Fperson".
OL,16,FGreen Party leader Zack Polanski, their
OL,17,Fcandidate in the by-election, told
OL,18,Fjournalists after the count that
OL,19,F"no-one runs an election to lose" but
OL,20,Fthe voters wanted to give new prime
OL,21,Fminister "a chance".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
